        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Leonotis, Psychopsis, Leonotis artemisia\n- Families: Lamiaceae, orchids\n- Places: Northern South America, Central America, Trinidad\n\nFacts:\n- Leonotis is a genus of flowering plants in the family Lamiaceae.\n- Psychopsis is a genus of five known orchid species native to northern South America, Central America, and Trinidad.\n- Psychopsis is abbreviated as Psychp in horticultural trade.\n- Leonotis artemisia is a plant species in the genus Leonotis and the family Lamiaceae.\n- Leonotis artemisia is also known as motherwort.",
